Package: rush
Title: R One-Liners from the Shell
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Jeroen",
           family = "Janssens",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jeroen@jeroenjanssens.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5878-8924"))
Description: Run R expressions and create plots directly from the shell.
    Each invocation assembles a self-contained script that is executed with
    the 'ir' command-line tool, which resolves the script's package
    dependencies on the fly.
